# Belt-and-braces at the repo root — backend/ and web/ each also have their
# own .gitignore scoping their build output, but this catches OS/editor
# cruft anywhere in the tree.
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
.idea/

# Agent tooling — TRACKED, unlike the two entries below it (decided 2026-09-30).
# .claude/ is not a notebook but tooling: the Sonnet subagents, the permission
# allowlist, and above all .claude/hooks/quota-guard.sh, which is what stops a
# DEMO_KEY quota burn. Left untracked, that guard would vanish without a sound on
# a clean clone. Only the personal overlays stay local:
/.claude/settings.local.json
/.claude/worktrees/

# Agent-facing working notes — local only, not part of the public repo.
/CLAUDE.md
/docs/agent/

/tools/php/
/tools/derniere-url.txt
/tools/calibration/.cache/
